      "text": "All safety measures are working as intended."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 28.5,
      "end_time": 30.6,
      "text": "Thank you, Riri-chan~"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 31.5,
      "end_time": 34.9,
      "text": "This way, even a shota can bounce without worries."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 35.2,
      "end_time": 37.4,
      "text": "So, it's as we agreed, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 38.1,
      "end_time": 39.2,
      "text": "Totally♡"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 39.4,
      "end_time": 41.1,
      "text": "If I win in butt sumo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 41.3,
      "end_time": 45.0,
      "text": "You'll turn this into the Shota Club~"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 45.2,
      "end_time": 45.9,
      "text": "Correct!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 46.1,
      "end_time": 47.6,
      "text": "But if Nea-san loses..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 47.8,
      "end_time": 50.4,
      "text": "I'll have you both join the Good Things Club."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 51.2,
      "end_time": 54.0,
      "text": "The rule is: first one to fall loses★"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 54.5,
      "end_time": 56.3,
      "text": "S-Shota Club...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
